# Personal AI Runtime v2

For non-trivial tasks, use the shared deterministic runtime instead of scanning every Skill or guessing which Skill to use:

```powershell
python "$env:USERPROFILE\.ai-workspace\runtime\aiw.py" context "<user task>"
```

Load only the returned Skills from `~/.cursor/skills/<id>/SKILL.md` (maximum five by default).

For explicit history/continuation requests, use `aiw.py memory search`. Private user/project memory lives outside the Git repo at `~/.ai-workspace/private-memory` or `AIW_PRIVATE_MEMORY_ROOT` and must never be bulk-injected into context.

Never treat hook execution, file existence, tests-only success, or Agent self-report as business acceptance.
